        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"145d320e-cdc8-4949-804c-e2c2776c544a\",\"review_text\":\"Awesome app, I recommend it seriously.👍❤️👍👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"724d136f-d682-4e2e-a449-7b7a38e84440\",\"review_text\":\"Just keep improving it.\"},{\"review_id\":\"cb350c99-88a8-4b67-a26b-6ebd53f10258\",\"review_text\":\"Supar app i lik it\"},{\"review_id\":\"cdbfaf93-47c2-433a-86fb-d343b6209adb\",\"review_text\":\"Best app for Listening music by my side, but should less ads strength 🙂👍👍👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"5e44e042-307e-463d-97b8-178cf568c1ac\",\"review_text\":\"quite good, but can the lyrics be added romaji? for example I want to sing Japanese song.. so I can read the romaji lyrics\"},{\"review_id\":\"a5c5a0f3-6e47-4dd2-8169-ea059cfc565c\",\"review_text\":\"I would like a little more control of what songs were playing.\"},{\"review_id\":\"becd8df0-5cb2-4956-9682-40bc69f4f272\",\"review_text\":\"The new update is the worst,the most stupidest thing to do is to remove the basic features which literally every music app has ,absolutely terrible,and on top of that...the ADS are still as annoying as before. I had to switch to a different app...thanks for making the most stupid upadate ever and digging your grave with it. RIP spotify\"},{\"review_id\":\"10042129-73f0-42ba-8fdf-df397d5f097e\",\"review_text\":\"The difference between Spotify songs and my ratings is my rating can go backward, enjoy my rating like adds.\"},{\"review_id\":\"a72abbd5-2ac4-4977-b790-7c3e80f7ef1b\",\"review_text\":\"Open music platform\"},{\"review_id\":\"71f654f6-5445-45c7-95e3-d0d71da0d5ae\",\"review_text\":\"I usually get my music on in the morning and Spotify has exactly what I need.\"}]}"
